<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa trade data to be released later this week.</title>
<headline>S.Africa trade data to be released later this week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>October trade data would be released towards the end of this week, a South African Revenue Services official said on Monday.</p>
<p>A Reuters consensus poll of economists has forecast a 900 million rand surplus compared with a 670 million rand surplus in September.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
